{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUG SPECIFICATION (Corvo addition)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The facts of a rug as a table, with short texts on its materials and on care.

The facts come from the rug fields of the product, so nothing is typed twice:

  - rug.craft_level (reference to a "craft_level" entry)
  - rug.materials (list of references to "rug_material" entries, each with its own description)
  - rug.pile (list of text: "Cut", "Loop")
  - rug.pile_height (text)
  - rug.colours (number) and rug.colour_refs (list of text)

A row without a value is left out.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign craft = product.metafields.rug.craft_level.value
  assign materials = product.metafields.rug.materials.value
  assign pile = product.metafields.rug.pile.value
  assign pile_height = product.metafields.rug.pile_height.value
  assign colour_count = product.metafields.rug.colours.value
  assign colour_refs = product.metafields.rug.colour_refs.value
  assign color_scheme_hash = section.settings.color_scheme.settings.background_gradient | default: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.background | md5

  comment
    The collection of the rug: the first collection of the menu that contains it
  endcomment

  assign rug_collection = nil
  assign product_collection_handles = product.collections | map: 'handle'

  for link in section.settings.collection_menu.links
    if link.type == 'collection_link' and product_collection_handles contains link.object.handle
      assign rug_collection = link.object
      break
    endif
  endfor

  comment
    The standard sizes: the values of the "Size" option (or of the first option), written as "150 × 200"
  endcomment

  assign size_option = product.options_with_values | first

  for option in product.options_with_values
    assign option_name = option.name | downcase | strip

    if option_name == 'size'
      assign size_option = option
      break
    endif
  endfor

  assign sizes_text = ''

  unless product.has_only_default_variant
    for option_value in size_option.values
      assign size_label = option_value.name | downcase | remove: 'cm' | strip | escape | replace: 'x', '&nbsp;×&nbsp;'

      if forloop.first
        assign sizes_text = size_label
      else
        assign sizes_text = sizes_text | append: ' · ' | append: size_label
      endif
    endfor

    if sizes_text != blank
      assign sizes_text = sizes_text | append: '&nbsp;cm'
    endif
  endunless

  comment
    The pile, in words
  endcomment

  comment
    Facts in plain words, for every reader that does not run scripts (search engines, AI assistants): the price per
    m² with VAT, the standard sizes with their prices, and the sample
  endcomment

  assign vat_percent = settings.rug_vat_percent | default: 23
  assign own_supplement = product.metafields.rug.supplement.value | default: 0
  assign per_m2 = 0

  if craft.retail_per_m2.value != blank
    assign own_factor = own_supplement | plus: 100 | divided_by: 100.0
    assign vat_factor = vat_percent | plus: 100 | divided_by: 100.0
    assign per_m2 = craft.retail_per_m2.value | times: own_factor | times: vat_factor | times: 100 | round
  endif

  comment
    The price per m² is worked out in the shop's currency: "fx" turns it into the visitor's currency
  endcomment

  capture fx
    render 'rug-fx'
  endcapture

  comment
    The texts of the table. A text of the section may hold markers such as [max_size] (see the "corvo-fill" snippet).
    The order facts are the shop's standard sentences, unless the section gives its own words.
  endcomment

  assign made_to_measure_escaped = section.settings.made_to_measure_text | escape
  assign lead_time_escaped = section.settings.lead_time_text | escape
  assign delivery_escaped = section.settings.delivery_text | escape
  assign orders_escaped = section.settings.orders_text | escape
  assign returns_escaped = section.settings.returns_text | escape

  capture made_to_measure_text
    render 'corvo-fill', text: made_to_measure_escaped
  endcapture

  capture lead_time_text
    if lead_time_escaped != blank
      render 'corvo-fill', text: lead_time_escaped
    else
      render 'corvo-fact', fact: 'lead_time'
    endif
  endcapture

  capture delivery_text
    if delivery_escaped != blank
      render 'corvo-fill', text: delivery_escaped
    else
      render 'corvo-fact', fact: 'delivery'
    endif
  endcapture

  capture orders_text
    if orders_escaped != blank
      render 'corvo-fill', text: orders_escaped
    else
      render 'corvo-fact', fact: 'orders'
    endif
  endcapture

  capture returns_text
    if returns_escaped != blank
      render 'corvo-fill', text: returns_escaped
    else
      render 'corvo-fact', fact: 'returns'
    endif
  endcapture

  assign made_to_measure_text = made_to_measure_text | strip
  assign lead_time_text = lead_time_text | strip
  assign delivery_text = delivery_text | strip
  assign orders_text = orders_text | strip
  assign returns_text = returns_text | strip

  comment
    Inside the opening paragraph each fact ends with one full stop, whether or not the text brings its own
  endcomment

  assign made_to_measure_sentence = made_to_measure_text | append: '§' | remove: '.§' | remove: '§'
  assign lead_time_sentence = lead_time_text | append: '§' | remove: '.§' | remove: '§'
  assign delivery_sentence = delivery_text | append: '§' | remove: '.§' | remove: '§'

  assign rug_sample = nil

  if section.settings.sample_handle != blank
    assign rug_sample = all_products[section.settings.sample_handle]

    unless rug_sample.available
      assign rug_sample = nil
    endunless
  endif

  assign pile_label = ''

  if pile contains 'Cut' and pile contains 'Loop'
    assign pile_label = 'rug_page.spec.pile_cut_loop' | t
  elsif pile contains 'Cut'
    assign pile_label = 'rug_page.spec.pile_cut' | t
  elsif pile contains 'Loop'
    assign pile_label = 'rug_page.spec.pile_loop' | t
  endif
-%}

{%- if product != blank -%}
  <div class="section-spacing color-scheme color-scheme--{{ section.settings.color_scheme.id }} color-scheme--bg-{{ color_scheme_hash }} {% if section.settings.separate_section_with_border %}bordered-section{% endif %}">
    <div class="container container--lg">
      <div class="rug-spec">
        <div class="rug-spec__facts">
          {%- if section.settings.title != blank -%}
            <h2 class="h3">{{ section.settings.title | escape }}</h2>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if section.settings.show_summary -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign material_names = materials | map: 'name' | map: 'value' | join: ', '
              assign first_variant = product.variants | first
              assign last_variant = product.variants | last
              assign first_size = first_variant.title | downcase | remove: 'cm' | strip | replace: 'x', ' × ' | append: ' cm'
              assign last_size = last_variant.title | downcase | remove: 'cm' | strip | replace: 'x', ' × ' | append: ' cm'

              capture first_price
                render 'rug-money', amount: first_variant.price
              endcapture

              capture last_price
                render 'rug-money', amount: last_variant.price
              endcapture

              capture per_m2_price
                render 'rug-money', amount: per_m2, fx: fx
              endcapture
            -%}

            <p class="rug-spec__summary">
              {{ 'rug_page.facts.intro' | t: name: product.title }}

              {%- if rug_collection != blank %} {{ 'rug_page.facts.collection' | t: collection: rug_collection.title }}{% endif -%}
              {%- if material_names != blank %} {{ 'rug_page.facts.materials' | t: materials: material_names }}{% endif -%}
              {%- if pile_label != blank %} {{ 'rug_page.facts.pile' | t: pile: pile_label, height: pile_height }}{% endif -%}

              {%- if colour_count == 1 %} {{ 'rug_page.facts.colours_one' | t }}{% elsif colour_count != blank %} {{ 'rug_page.facts.colours_other' | t: count: colour_count }}{% endif -%}

              {%- unless product.has_only_default_variant %} {{ 'rug_page.facts.sizes' | t: count: product.variants.size, smallest: first_size, low: first_price, largest: last_size, high: last_price }}{% endunless -%}

              {%- if per_m2 > 0 and made_to_measure_text != blank %} {{ 'rug_page.facts.measure' | t: limit: made_to_measure_sentence, price: per_m2_price }}{% endif -%}
              {%- if lead_time_text != blank %} {{ 'rug_page.facts.lead_time' | t: text: lead_time_sentence }}{% endif -%}
              {%- if delivery_text != blank %} {{ 'rug_page.facts.delivery' | t: text: delivery_sentence }}{% endif -%}
            </p>
          {%- endif -%}

          <dl class="rug-spec__table">
            {%- if rug_collection != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.collection' | t }}</dt>
                <dd><a href="{{ rug_collection.url }}" class="link">{{ rug_collection.title | escape }}</a></dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if craft != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.craft_level' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>
                  <span>{{ craft.label.value | escape }}</span>

                  {%- if craft.description.value != blank -%}
                    <span class="text-sm text-subdued">{{ craft.description.value | escape }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}

                  {%- if section.settings.craft_note != blank -%}
                    <span class="text-sm text-subdued">{{ section.settings.craft_note | escape }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if materials != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.materials' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>
                  {%- capture material_names -%}
                    {%- for material in materials -%}
                      {{- material.name.value | escape -}}
                      {%- unless forloop.last -%}, {% endunless -%}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  {%- endcapture -%}

                  <span>{{ material_names | strip }}</span>
                </dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if pile_label != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.pile' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ pile_label }}</dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if pile_height != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.pile_height' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ pile_height | escape }}</dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if colour_count != blank or colour_refs != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.colours' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>
                  {%- if colour_count != blank -%}
                    <span>
                      {%- if colour_count == 1 -%}
                        {{- 'rug_page.colours_one' | t -}}
                      {%- else -%}
                        {{- 'rug_page.colours_other' | t: count: colour_count -}}
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </span>
                  {%- endif -%}

                  {%- if colour_refs != blank -%}
                    {%- assign colour_refs_list = colour_refs | join: ', ' -%}
                    <span class="text-sm text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.references' | t: list: colour_refs_list }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if sizes_text != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.sizes' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>
                  {%- comment -%}Each standard size with its price, as text{%- endcomment -%}
                  <ul class="rug-spec__sizes unstyled-list" role="list">
                    {%- for size_variant in product.variants -%}
                      <li>
                        <span>{{ size_variant.title | downcase | remove: 'cm' | strip | escape | replace: 'x', '&nbsp;×&nbsp;' }}&nbsp;cm</span>
                        <span class="text-subdued">{%- render 'rug-money', amount: size_variant.price -%}</span>
                      </li>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </ul>
                </dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if made_to_measure_text != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.made_to_measure' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>
                  <span>
                    {{- made_to_measure_text -}}

                    {%- if section.settings.custom_link != blank and section.settings.custom_link_text != blank %}
                      <a href="{{ section.settings.custom_link }}" class="link">{{ section.settings.custom_link_text | escape }}</a>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </span>

                  {%- if per_m2 > 0 -%}
                    {%- capture per_m2_text -%}{%- render 'rug-money', amount: per_m2, fx: fx -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                    <span class="text-sm text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.spec.per_m2' | t: price: per_m2_text }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if rug_sample != nil -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign sample_variant = rug_sample.selected_or_first_available_variant
                assign sample_size = sample_variant.title | downcase | remove: 'cm' | strip | replace: 'x', ' × ' | append: ' cm'

                capture sample_price
                  render 'rug-money', amount: sample_variant.price
                endcapture
              -%}

              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.sample' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ 'rug_page.spec.sample_value' | t: size: sample_size, price: sample_price }}</dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if lead_time_text != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.lead_time' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ lead_time_text }}</dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if delivery_text != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.delivery' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ delivery_text }}</dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if orders_text != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.orders' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ orders_text }}</dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if returns_text != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.returns' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ returns_text }}</dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if section.settings.made_in != blank -%}
              <div class="rug-spec__row">
                <dt>{{ 'rug_page.spec.made_in' | t }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ section.settings.made_in | escape }}</dd>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </dl>

          {%- if section.settings.note != blank -%}
            <div class="prose text-sm text-subdued">
              {{- section.settings.note -}}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        <div class="rug-spec__texts">
          {%- if materials != blank -%}
            <div class="rug-spec__text">
              {%- if section.settings.materials_title != blank -%}
                <h2 class="h3">{{ section.settings.materials_title | escape }}</h2>
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- for material in materials -%}
                {%- if material.description.value != blank -%}
                  <div class="rug-spec__material">
                    <h3 class="h6">{{ material.name.value | escape }}</h3>
                    <p>{{ material.description.value | escape }}</p>
                  </div>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}

              {%- if section.settings.materials_link != blank and section.settings.materials_link_text != blank -%}
                <p><a href="{{ section.settings.materials_link }}" class="link">{{ section.settings.materials_link_text | escape }}</a></p>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if section.settings.care_text != blank -%}
            <div class="rug-spec__text">
              {%- if section.settings.care_title != blank -%}
                <h2 class="h3">{{ section.settings.care_title | escape }}</h2>
              {%- endif -%}

              <div class="prose">
                {{- section.settings.care_text -}}
              </div>

              {%- if section.settings.care_link != blank and section.settings.care_link_text != blank -%}
                <p><a href="{{ section.settings.care_link }}" class="link">{{ section.settings.care_link_text | escape }}</a></p>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .rug-spec {
    gap: 3rem;
    display: grid;
  }

  .rug-spec__facts,
  .rug-spec__texts {
    align-content: start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    display: grid;
  }

  .rug-spec__texts {
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .rug-spec__summary {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin-block-end: 1.5rem;
  }

  .rug-spec__sizes {
    gap: .25rem;
    display: grid;
  }

  .rug-spec__sizes li {
    gap: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
  }

  .rug-spec__sizes li > :first-child {
    min-width: 7.5rem;
  }

  .rug-spec__table {
    border-block-start: 1px solid rgb(var(--border-color));
    margin: 0;
  }

  .rug-spec__row {
    border-block-end: 1px solid rgb(var(--border-color));
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 8rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-block: .875rem;
    display: grid;
  }

  .rug-spec__row dt {
    color: rgb(var(--text-color) / .65);
  }

  .rug-spec__row dd {
    justify-items: start;
    gap: .25rem;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
  }

  .rug-spec__text {
    gap: 1rem;
    display: grid;
  }

  .rug-spec__material {
    gap: .375rem;
    display: grid;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 700px) {
    .rug-spec__row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 11rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1000px) {
    .rug-spec {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, .85fr);
      align-items: start;
      gap: 5rem;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Rug specification",
  "class": "shopify-section--rug-specification",
  "tag": "section",
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["product"]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Shows the facts stored on the rug: craft level, materials, pile, pile height and colours. Each material brings its own description. A row without a value is left out."
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Colour scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "separate_section_with_border",
      "label": "Separate the section with a line",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "collection_menu",
      "label": "Menu of collections",
      "info": "The rug's collection is the first one of this menu that contains it."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Specification"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "Specification"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "craft_note",
      "label": "Line under the craft level",
      "default": "The craft level measures how demanding a design is to make. It sets the price per m²."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_summary",
      "label": "Open with the facts in plain words",
      "info": "One short paragraph written from the rug's own facts and prices. It helps search engines and AI assistants as much as people.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "made_to_measure_text",
      "label": "Made to measure",
      "info": "[max_size] is filled in from the theme settings, under \"Corvo: prices and rules\".",
      "default": "Any size up to [max_size]."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Leave the next four empty to show the shop's standard sentences, which follow the theme settings. Fill one in only to say it differently on rug pages."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "lead_time_text",
      "label": "Lead time"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "delivery_text",
      "label": "Delivery"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "orders_text",
      "label": "Changes and cancellations"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "returns_text",
      "label": "Returns"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "sample_handle",
      "label": "Handle of the sample product",
      "default": "rug-sample"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "custom_link",
      "label": "Made to measure, link"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "custom_link_text",
      "label": "Made to measure, link text",
      "default": "Tailor your rug"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "made_in",
      "label": "Made in",
      "default": "Portugal"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "note",
      "label": "Note under the table",
      "default": "<p>The colours shown are indicative. Natural materials and artisanal processes may give variations in colour and texture.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Materials"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "materials_title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "Materials"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "materials_link",
      "label": "Link"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "materials_link_text",
      "label": "Link text",
      "default": "About our materials"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Care"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "care_title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "Care"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "care_text",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Vacuum regularly without rotating brushes, attend to spills promptly and rotate the rug from time to time. Keep it out of prolonged sunlight and rely on professional cleaning when needed.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "care_link",
      "label": "Link"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "care_link_text",
      "label": "Link text",
      "default": "Care and FAQ"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Rug specification"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
